No commercial vendor or product names in any file or path (docs/banned-terms.txt, docs/NAMING.md)

Usage: cargo xtask check-banned-terms [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --digest <term>
          Print the list line for a new term instead of checking

  -h, --help
          Print help
